DESCRIPTION

   Easygadgets.library is a library I built for my own use. It contains
   functions that make it a lot simpler to create and maintain a
   scalable and font-adaptable GUI.

   Many of my other projects, such as Recall and EasyRexx, make use of
   this library.

   This library, and especially its sourcecode, was never intended for
   the public. The code is undocumented. If you find it useful; GREAT, if
   not, just ignore it...

SPECIAL REQUIREMENTS

  OS 2.04 or higher.

AVAILABILITY

  ftp://ftp.wustl.edu/pub/aminet/dev/c/EasygadgetsSource.lha (93.663)

